  "description": "Success on Onstagram is tough. No matter how pretty you are, you need both luck and a good photographer. Well our main character is the best there is, he can turn any aspiring social media star into a sensation with his skill with a camera. Underneath that superstar photographer image however, he is just a shy college kid who can't even ask out his crush. But after his identity gets revealed, he finds that he'll have to become comfortable with girls very quickly...\n\n(Source: TOPTOON+)",
